flowchart TD
    Start([System Components]) --> Collect[Data Collection Layer]
    
    Collect --> Metrics[Prometheus Metrics]
    Collect --> Logs[Centralized Logging<br/>Elasticsearch]
    Collect --> Traces[Distributed Tracing<br/>Jaeger]
    Collect --> Events[Event Stream<br/>Kafka]
    
    Metrics --> MetricsDB[(Prometheus<br/>Time Series DB)]
    Logs --> LogsDB[(Elasticsearch<br/>Log Storage)]
    Traces --> TracesDB[(Jaeger<br/>Trace Storage)]
    Events --> EventsDB[(Kafka<br/>Event Log)]
    
    MetricsDB --> Grafana[Grafana Dashboards]
    LogsDB --> Kibana[Kibana Log Analysis]
    TracesDB --> JaegerUI[Jaeger UI]
    EventsDB --> StreamProcess[Stream Processing]
    
    Grafana --> AlertMgr[Alert Manager]
    Kibana --> AlertMgr
    StreamProcess --> AlertMgr
    
    AlertMgr --> Rules{Alert Rules<br/>Evaluation}
    
    Rules -->|Critical| P0Alert[P0 Critical Alert<br/>- System Down<br/>- Data Breach<br/>- Error Rate >5%]
    Rules -->|Warning| P1Alert[P1 Warning Alert<br/>- High CPU >80%<br/>- Memory >85%<br/>- Slow Response]
    Rules -->|Info| P2Alert[P2 Info Alert<br/>- Approaching Limits<br/>- Unusual Patterns]
    
    P0Alert --> PagerDuty[PagerDuty<br/>Immediate Page]
    P1Alert --> Slack[Slack Alert<br/>@oncall]
    P2Alert --> Email[Email Notification<br/>Team Inbox]
    
    PagerDuty --> Response[Incident Response<br/>Team Mobilizes]
    Slack --> Review[Engineer Reviews<br/>Takes Action]
    Email --> Monitor[Monitor & Track<br/>No Immediate Action]
    
    Response --> Actions{Response<br/>Actions}
    
    Actions --> AutoScale[Auto-Scaling<br/>Triggered]
    Actions --> CircuitBreaker[Circuit Breaker<br/>Activated]
    Actions --> Failover[Failover<br/>to DR Site]
    Actions --> ManualFix[Manual<br/>Intervention]
    
    AutoScale --> Verify[Verify Resolution]
    CircuitBreaker --> Verify
    Failover --> Verify
    ManualFix --> Verify
    
    Verify --> MetricsDB
    
    Review --> UpdateDash[Update Runbook<br/>Document Fix]
    Monitor --> Trend[Trend Analysis<br/>Capacity Planning]
    
    UpdateDash --> End([Monitoring Continues])
    Trend --> End
    
    style Start fill:#6366f1,stroke:#4f46e5,color:#fff
    style P0Alert fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style P1Alert fill:#ffd93d,stroke:#f59f00
    style P2Alert fill:#90ee90,stroke:#2f9e44
    style End fill:#6b7280,stroke:#4b5563,color:#fff
